<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS2" title="In Appendix B Higher torsion of fiber bundles ‣ Legendrian and Lagrangian higher torsion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.2 </span>The Whitehead category</span></a></li>
