<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S2" title="In Legendrian and Lagrangian higher torsion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">2 </span>Legendrian higher torsion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S3" title="In Legendrian and Lagrangian higher torsion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3 </span>Legendrian tube torsion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4" title="In Legendrian and Lagrangian higher torsion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4 </span>Nearby Lagrangian torsion</span></a></li>
