<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6. </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#S1.Thmtheorem15" title="Theorem 1.15. ‣ 1.1. Main results ‣ 1. Introduction ‣ Legendrian and Lagrangian higher torsion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1.15</span></a>, Step 1: Construct a function on the tube bundle <math id="S3.F6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math> whose Cerf diagram has a copy of the zero section and a bunch of wrinkles.</figcaption>
</figure>
